 \/>Pourquoi les talents africains sont-ils comp\u00e9titifs ?<\/strong><br data-start=\"3265\" data-end=\"3268\" \/>Ils offrent un \u00e9quilibre entre comp\u00e9tences techniques, qualit\u00e9 de service et flexibilit\u00e9. Cette combinaison permet aux entreprises d\u2019optimiser leurs performances tout en ma\u00eetrisant leurs co\u00fbts.<\/p><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><h2 data-section-id=\"4jgdil\" data-start=\"334\" data-end=\"363\"><span role=\"text\">D\u00e9veloppement web \/ IT<\/span><\/h2><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\"><table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"365\" data-end=\"551\"><thead data-start=\"365\" data-end=\"397\"><tr data-start=\"365\" data-end=\"397\"><th class=\"\" data-start=\"365\" data-end=\"374\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Niveau<\/th><th class=\"\" data-start=\"374\" data-end=\"397\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Salaire mensuel (\u20ac)<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"551\"><tr data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"467\"><td data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"450\" data-col-size=\"sm\">D\u00e9veloppeur junior<\/td><td data-start=\"450\" data-end=\"467\" data-col-size=\"sm\">900 \u2013 1 600 \u20ac<\/td><\/tr><tr data-start=\"468\" data-end=\"513\"><td data-start=\"468\" data-end=\"494\" data-col-size=\"sm\">D\u00e9veloppeur exp\u00e9riment\u00e9<\/td><td data-start=\"494\" data-end=\"513\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1 600 \u2013 3 100 \u20ac<\/td><\/tr><tr data-start=\"514\" data-end=\"551\"><td data-start=\"514\" data-end=\"532\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Senior \/ expert<\/td><td data-start=\"532\" data-end=\"551\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3 100 \u2013 5 100 \u20ac<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-029df9a elementor-cta--layout-image-left elementor-cta--tablet-layout-ima